        ],
        "evidence": [
          {
            "id": "S1E6",
            "sourceId": "22d9e3d39f2a88cf",
            "quote": "Police arrested about 1,800 people on Saturday as some 550,000 demonstrators took to the streets for protests that were largely peaceful."
          },
          {
            "id": "S1E14",
            "sourceId": "22d9e3d39f2a88cf",
            "quote": "Widespread looting took place across the cities of Paris, Marseille and Lille, as well as other areas."
          },
          {
            "id": "S1E3",
            "sourceId": "22d9e3d39f2a88cf",
            "quote": "More than 500 police officers, gendarmes and firefighters were injured in the unrest on Saturday, France's interior ministry said."
          },
          {
            "id": "S1E7",
            "sourceId": "22d9e3d39f2a88cf",
            "quote": "About 1,500 shops and retailers were also damaged in the disturbances, the Retail and Trade Federation said."
          },
          {
            "id": "S1E9",
            "sourceId": "22d9e3d39f2a88cf",
            "quote": "They were demonstrating against rising fuel prices, the cost of living and deteriorating public services, including schools."
          },
          {
            "id": "S2E1",
            "sourceId": "096a7b8d06624333",
            "quote": "Noah Adams, a writer, broadcaster, and storyteller who hosted All Things Considered for 18 years, has died."
          },
          {
            "id": "S2E7",
            "sourceId": "096a7b8d06624333",
            "quote": "Adams died Friday at his home in Yellow Springs, Ohio, according to his wife, Neenah Ellis. He was 84."
          },
          {
            "id": "S2E2",
            "sourceId": "096a7b8d06624333",
            "quote": "Adams would ride trains across the country, or spend days in small towns talking to whoever he came across. He'd ask questions. He'd listen."
          },
          {
            "id": "S2E18",
            "sourceId": "096a7b8d06624333",
            "quote": "\"He was always observing,\" recalled Melissa Block, who produced pieces alongside Adams for years before hosting All Things Considered herself."
          },
          {
            "id": "S2E5",
            "sourceId": "096a7b8d06624333",
            "quote": "Over the years Glass would repeatedly cite Adams and his interviewing style as an inspiration for the feel and tone of the public radio program"
          },
          {
            "id": "S2E6",
            "sourceId": "096a7b8d06624333",
            "quote": "he'd go on to create: This American Life."
          },
          {
            "id": "S2E22",
            "sourceId": "096a7b8d06624333",
            "quote": "\"He would have a little reporter's notebook and he would be taking notes in shorthand."
          },
          {
            "id": "S3E2",
            "sourceId": "a194f78f613bd74e",
            "quote": "the 70th BFI London Film Festival competition."
          },
          {
            "id": "S3E6",
            "sourceId": "a194f78f613bd74e",
            "quote": "The Grierson Award for documentary went to Asmahan Bkerat’s feature directorial debut “Concrete Land,” which spends time with several generations of a mixed-race family in"
          },
          {
            "id": "S3E7",
            "sourceId": "a194f78f613bd74e",
            "quote": "Jordan as they resist displacement and hostility."
          },
          {
            "id": "S3E10",
            "sourceId": "a194f78f613bd74e",
            "quote": "“Santosh” director Sandhya Suri headed the documentary jury, alongside Melbourne International Film Festival senior programmer Kate Fitzpatrick and BAFTA and Emmy-winning producer Andee Ryder."
          },
          {
            "id": "S3E14",
            "sourceId": "a194f78f613bd74e",
            "quote": "“In a noisy and often polemical world it was refreshing, humbling and deeply relevant to see the quiet resilience and dignity of this family in"
          },
          {
            "id": "S3E15",
            "sourceId": "a194f78f613bd74e",
            "quote": "the face of the erasure of their culture and traditions,” the jury said."
          },
          {
            "id": "S6E1",
            "sourceId": "1f91918277b7fd64",
            "quote": "A search for the wreckage of Amelia Earhart's plane on a remote island in the Pacific Ocean has resumed after severe weather caused researchers to"
          },
          {
            "id": "S6E2",
            "sourceId": "1f91918277b7fd64",
            "quote": "stop for several days."
          },
          {
            "id": "S6E8",
            "sourceId": "1f91918277b7fd64",
            "quote": "A team has travelled to Nikumaroro Island, part of Kiribati, hoping to solve the mystery of the famed aviator's disappearance by investigating the so-called Taraia"
          },
          {
            "id": "S6E9",
            "sourceId": "1f91918277b7fd64",
            "quote": "Object, spotted in the atoll's lagoon in aerial imagery."
          },
          {
            "id": "S6E6",
            "sourceId": "1f91918277b7fd64",
            "quote": "While researchers have previously found evidence of a human presence on the island around the time of Earhart's disappearance, some skeptics believe the Taraia Object"
          },
          {
            "id": "S6E7",
            "sourceId": "1f91918277b7fd64",
            "quote": "was just a tree that had fallen from the atoll into the lagoon."
          },
          {
            "id": "S6E15",
            "sourceId": "1f91918277b7fd64",
            "quote": "Previous attempts to find her Electra have also come up short."
          }
        ],
